        "raw": "<p>This card from the Time Cataclysm Environment deck deals 1 damage to everything whenever a card is &quot;put into play&quot;.&nbsp; I was not clear on whether this includes One-Shot cards, but we had Mr. Fixer in the game, and his Scrap Yard card says in part, &quot;Then, if you have the card Overdrive in your trash, you may <strong>put it into play</strong>.&quot;&nbsp; This somewhat odd wording seemed to imply that One-Shots do indeed trigger SST, so I went with that interpretation...and as a result, La Capitan ground through four already damage-dealing One-Shots in her turn, having gotten all of her other cards on the table by now, and we heroes died miserably when we&#39;d already been losing by inches.</p><p>Did I play this correctly?&nbsp; Or is SST supposed to only be triggered by cards that stay in play past the resolution of their effects?</p>",
