        "id": 73531,
        "name": "dypaca",
        "username": "dypaca",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/dypaca/{size}/2079_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-09-14T15:58:08.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>One shots are put into play and do trigger Surprise Shopping trip.</p><p>Anything which is played is 'put into play', however some card effects will cause something to be 'put into play' without being played.&nbsp; This is important for things which trigger off of a card being played or which prevent you from playing cards, but for Surprise Shopping trip it triggers in both cases.</p>",
        "post_number": 2,
